            "occurrence_ids": [],
            "disposition": "stock_product_mixture_context",
            "reasoning": "The full JCM978 recipe uses 5 ml Mineral solution (see Medium No. 976, including its unclosed parenthesis. The referenced source is JCM976, not DSMZ976. Its mineral stock is EDTA 3.7 g, FeSO4·7H2O 1.1 g, MnCl2·4H2O 98.4 mg, ZnSO4·7H2O 28.8 mg, CoCl2·6H2O 23.8 mg, CuCl2·2H2O 17.2 mg, Na2MoO4·2H2O 24.2 mg and H3BO3 31.0 mg in 1 L distilled water, adjusted to pH6 with KOH. The existing local stock record is lexical continuity but lacks components and incorrectly names DSMZ976 in its history. The raw punctuation defect does not make the preparation scientifically uninterpretable. The guarded proposal now corrects the active source attribution and supplies every listed precursor plus variable KOH, preserving original history and current registry identity. Successor quantity representation uses explicit preparation-water units and non-resolving cross-reference labels; no final stock volume or globally applicable unqualified medium number is inferred.",
            "applicability": "Applies only to this exact source profile and source_case_id, preserving its raw label and frozen count definition. All admitted recipe contexts and embedded downstream holds are bound by the case evidence. Listed owner records are inspected current candidates; a candidate is approved only to the narrow scope expressly stated in reasoning. Registry correspondence does not approve external chemistry, whole owner records, biological claims or complete SSSOM payloads.",
