            "reasoning": "DSMZ632/1181 and their source-derived frozen recipes weigh ammonium ferric EDTA; public P10 explicitly reports that named reagent within a trace stock but remains an uncurated user dataset. Primary NLM M0313825 specifically denotes Fe(III)-EDTA,ammonium salt; C019179 parent descriptor includes other salts and is not exact. Canada substance assessment corroborates CAS21265-50-9. DSMZ1132 instead explicitly specifies Fe-NH4EDTA(4mg/ml),1.0ml; its four frozen derivatives refer to a stock, not weighed pure salt. Propose separate exact salt and source-qualified4mg/mLstock, preserving raw label ambiguity and receiving-medium errors.",
            "applicability": "All 11 frozen occurrences and full recipe snapshots reviewed. DSMZ632/1181 and their source-derived frozen recipes weigh ammonium ferric EDTA; public P10 explicitly reports that named reagent within a trace stock but remains an uncurated user dataset. Primary NLM M0313825 specifically denotes Fe(III)-EDTA,ammonium salt; C019179 parent descriptor includes other salts and is not exact. Canada substance assessment corroborates CAS21265-50-9. DSMZ1132 instead explicitly specifies Fe-NH4EDTA(4mg/ml),1.0ml; its four frozen derivatives refer to a stock, not weighed pure salt. Propose separate exact salt and source-qualified4mg/mLstock, preserving raw label ambiguity and receiving-medium errors. Exact occurrence scope is preserved; source transcription/receiving-medium errors remain separate publication holds. No downstream release, synchronization or rebuild is approved. Successor #1241 evidence-status correction: failed captures are retained as unsuccessful searches, and ontology captures are distinguished from original recipes. Their raw bytes and access times are unchanged.",
