            "applicability": "Issue1201 continuation of this exact frozen source case. DSMZ885 names PHC from Toagosei with Mn2000 and separately lists Plysurf. Primary environmental inventory entry11389 and supplier TechServe Solutions independently corroborate source CAS61630-98-6 for poly(hexamethylene carbonate) diol/polycarbonate of1,6-hexanediol. Registry scope covers a polymer chain-length distribution, so unavailable grade detail does not justify a local fallback. The revised proposal uses the CAS and broader CHEBI61433, without fixed chain length, structure, molecular mass or emulsion identity. CommonChemistry API401/navigation-only HTML and publisher403 are unsuccessful routes, not chemical evidence. Helper/incident-edge count definitions, original source ID and raw label are unchanged. Every inherited nonpositive row decision, source placeholder and downstream hold remains in force. Scope-specific proposals do not approve generic labels globally or release complete owner/export payloads. Successor #1241 evidence-status correction: failed captures are retained as unsuccessful searches, and ontology captures are distinguished from original recipes. Their raw bytes and access times are unchanged.",
