                "assessment": "ABEE is retained as REJECTED_LABEL: the primary Cosmo Bio GlyScope brochure explicitly identifies the ethyl ester, not CHEBI30753 free acid. The exact concentration token p-aminobenzoic acid (0.3 μg/μL) is also non-resolving: NBRC1604 explicitly adds10uL of that preparation and TOGO M3052 calls it4-aminobenzoic acid solution. No solvent, complete stock recipe, receiving concentration or transfer to an ester owner is inferred. Preserve the supported Paraamino benzoic acid alias. PMID31986050 remains genuine cocrystal context, qualified PARTIAL rather than exact-owner or role support; other charge aliases and provisional roles remain unapproved."
