            "reasoning": "ChEBI:27810 identifies resorcinol as benzene-1,3-diol, matching the explicit KOMODO source name. The archived2017 BacDive reproduction of DSMZ195 explicitly prescribes1mMresorcinol for DSM4661, and current DSMZ383 strain-specific PDF independently names resorcinol. No current active resorcinol owner was found in an ignored-inclusive full record scan.",
