            "reasoning": "The complete Togo M2596 source defines SS from Ithaca wastewater digester sludge: sequential centrifugation, pH7 adjustment with1M HCl,0.8µm prefiltration, nitrogen purge and0.8–0.2µm sterile filtration. It explicitly adds25%(v/v) SS. Sludge fluid in the frozen flattened recipe is a nested preparation input, not a separate basal supplement. The source does not add yeast extract during SS preparation; DSMZ119 yeast-treated sludge fluid is a different product. Propose this source-defined processed material without representing sludge/HCl extraction inputs as final molecular components.",
