            "applicability": "The sixteen occurrences comprise seven weighed reagent contexts supporting Tris hydrochloride salt, six stock contexts specifying 1 M at pH 7.5, two stock contexts specifying 0.5 M at pH 8.0, and TOGO M2313 stating 50 mM at pH 7.8 in the receiving minimal medium. That last context does not define a separately prepared stock. Preserve all exact occurrence subsets. The filed #1238 grade correction applies only to the solid salt; NEW-03 separately withdraws unsupported material components from the two buffer candidates.",
