              "parent_grounding": "Retain supplier-unspecified named Polypeptone as kgmicrobe.ingredient:polypeptone, with a NARROW_MATCH to the closer MeSH D010461 Peptones material category. Native section3 exact-term precedence is evaluated: MICRO:0000179 specifically defines the BD casein/animal-tissue blend and MICRO:0000178 adds enzymatic/mammalian restrictions; neither establishes the generic named material identity. The complete manufacturer guide printed7 supports the peptone partial protein-hydrolysate relation, independently consistent with NLM D010461 and M0016245. This does not import the BD formula or measured lot characteristics. The manufacturer general base-hydrolysis possibility is a terminology caveat, not evidence that these particular observations have a conflicting material. FoodOn member_of external agency categorization is not a source food-use or role prerequisite, so the earlier stronger formal-restriction inference is qualified. FOODON:03315306 and MeSH D011492 remain broader material alternatives; closer verified D010461 is selected under native precedence. None of these mappings transfers the old exact generic FoodOn identity to the named preparation.",
