            "case_index": 12,
            "correction_reassessment": {
              "status": "complete",
              "issue": 1193,
              "changed": true,
              "assessment": "Two positive subset proposals distinguish DSMZ804powder from TOGO M2937prepared broth. DSMZ804 primary PDF identifies21gMueller-Hintonbroth as a dry medium input, separate from5gyeast,1000mlwater andX/Vfactor supplements. Register this source-supplied powder without selecting a manufacturer or cation adjustment. Current OxoidCM0405 is a comparison, not a catalog assignment. Existing MuellerHintonIIagar is a different solid medium preparation; no maintained MHbroth owner exists. The M2937prepared broth is a separate supplied state whose reconstitution/equivalence is not inferred. TOGO M2937 primary comments distinguish Mueller-Hintonbroth from MHagar plates and name optionalciprofloxacin as a later addition. Register the prepared broth used in that source without inventing manufacturer,cation adjustment, internalformula or powder reconstitution. Its liquid broth state is distinct from DSMZ804powder and existing MHIIagar; the1Lparsed row is not a proof of an experimental batch volume. No globalMHbroth alias or exact commercial equivalence is asserted.",
              "primary_searches_performed": [
                "Re-read full frozen source contexts and all current matching occurrences in saved family inventory.",
                "Re-read captured primary supplier or culture collection source at cited precise locator; compare exact product identity and separate added supplements.",
