              "assessment": "The broad Mueller-Hinton broth case contains two supplied states: DSMZ 804 weighs 21 g medium powder before separate yeast, NAD and hemin; TOGO M2937 uses prepared broth and distinguishes agar plates and later ciprofloxacin. The two bounded proposals preserve those states without selecting a brand, cation adjustment or unreported reconstitution link.",
