              "precise_scope": "Retarget only this source-supported generic peptone part from the earlier conditional local identity kgmicrobe.ingredient:peptone to the reviewed direct generic identity mesh:D010461 (Peptones), represented by the Peptone owner. The primary NLM descriptor explicitly includes Peptone; its conventional partial protein-hydrolysis definition and the manufacturer generic description support the ordinary unspecified peptone sense under MAPPING_SEMANTICS section3 exact-term priority. Unknown supplier, lot or digestion detail does not itself establish a different material or require a new process/precipitation assay gate. The raw named-input evidence and material scope are unchanged. The previous local-target event and assertion notes are preserved as superseded routing history. Preserve LABEL_ENUMERATION and COMPLETE relative to the named inputs, all quantities and their absence, raw labels, source occurrences and all other parts. This does not assign Bacto, animal origin, supplier product, formulation equivalence, source-assay admission, roles or export approval. Apply only with the exact reviewed direct Peptone parent in the same phase; no global identifier replacement.",
