              "conclusion": "The two MicrobeDecoder peptones observations remain unspecified as to feedstock, supplier, processing and assay conditions. The generic owner retains kgmicrobe.ingredient:peptone with supported nonidentity mesh:D011492 Protein Hydrolysates grounding. Direct MeSH Peptones acid-or-enzyme/precipitation scope was assessed but is not fully established; the broader partial-or-extensive hydrolysis material definition is supported. The initial FoodOn candidate is unselected after formal food-additive membership restriction discovery. Preserve both raw observations, plural provenance, truncated-token rejection, histories/statistics and all role/source/export holds. Dependent references require separate source-level reconciliation.",
