            "issue1237_scope_correction": "Issue1237 MIN-F01: DSM590/1144 support one nominal Hutner preparation. Both source origins and histories remain retained inputs to the coordinator root C union. Neither is selected as a winner here and these two candidates are not independently co-installable. Preserve CaCl2·2H2O 3.335 g versus 3.34 g rounding, both malformed molybdate literals and both Metals44/process accounts. Historical molecular clarification is a separate requirement from the settled nominal union; no new union is composed by W07.",
