            "reasoning": "NBRC 1321 footnote ****** explicitly defines Cyanocobalamin 5 mg plus distilled water 100 mL and filtration. This resolves the vitamer for this occurrence only. The prepared stock remains distinct from the pure cyanocobalamin ingredient and from JCM 403, which uses the generic B12 name. A source-specific stock owner is proposed. IR004 duplicate comparison: the same printed B12 mass and water volume in JCM 403 do not establish stock equivalence because JCM 403 does not name a vitamer. Neither chemical difference nor a cross-source merge is inferred; the explicit cyanocobalamin assertion remains specific to NBRC 1321.",
