            "disposition": "stock_product_mixture_context",
            "reasoning": "The actual source stock context and preparation instructions remain established. A separate owner is withdrawn because the available material facts do not demonstrate a distinct reagent from the stronger documented anchor. The direct anchor remains ATCC 1942, whose 10 ml stock dose and 0.5 g/L final amount support 5% w/v and whose stock is autoclaved under nitrogen. JCM 1020 and previously linked JCM cases specify 5% nonahydrate stocks but omit the percent basis and/or exact stock atmosphere. These omissions do not establish a different substance. Preserve their autoclaving and source instructions as conditional comparisons; do not transfer the ATCC basis, carrier or gas treatment to them or assert exact shared preparation. Issue 1227 completeness refinement: if1201-new-atcc_1942_sulfide_5pct is UNKNOWN relative to its cited source input list. This does not change the case-specific source-form or comparison restrictions.",
