            "occurrence_ids": [],
            "disposition": "stock_product_mixture_context",
            "reasoning": "The captured MediaDive ingredient1685 record explicitly lists J209. Its frozen KG source_record exactly matches J209 M98-5 recipe_order12:100ml Na2CO3-CO2 buffer with attribute4%. TOGO M202 declares original_media_id JCM_M209, the same JCM209 source URL and M98-5 name, and the matching100ml nominal4% buffer row. These positive source and occurrence bindings justify associating this KG context with the existing source-qualified stock kgmicrobe.ingredient:carbonate_co2_nominal4percent_togo_m202. No second stock owner or changed stock chemistry is needed. The existing rejection of the buffer label on pure carbonate remains correct; MediaDive solute annotations do not define the whole stock.",
            "applicability": "Applies only to the frozen mediadive.ingredient:1685 raw recipe row now explicitly traced through ingredient1685.media[0]=J209 to JCM209/M98-5 and TOGO M202. The complete frozen KG case has no CM_OCC IDs, and its helper occurrence count is not a recipe-frequency measurement. Preserve the prior case21 CM_OCC binding unchanged; add this KG source-context backlink in proposal metadata without globally resolving Na2CO3-CO2 buffer or nominal4% strings. No whole-receiving-medium EXACT_FORMULATION relationship, all-occurrence generalization, or carbonate-solute identity follows.",
            "missing_requirement": "No additional fact is required for this bounded same-source stock association. The4% basis, carrier, carbonate hydration, CO2 dose/equilibration endpoint and full preparation remain unknown; they limit quantitative/composition claims and do not defer the already represented source identity. Sodium_Carbonate_Solution and inherited pure-owner/export claims still require their separate content-bound review.",
