            "disposition": "new_distinct_ingredient_proposal",
            "reasoning": "UTEX vitamin B12, biotin and thiamine instructions prepare 200 mL of 50 mM HEPES buffer, adjust it to pH 7.8, and only then add the vitamin. The HEPES entry is 2.4 g/200 mL dH2O, Sigma H3375. All 68 frozen occurrences of this case were read. Vitamins and their later filtration instructions are not imported into this stand-alone buffer identity. The pH-adjusting reagent and its amount are unspecified. The source recipe supports HEPES and distilled water parts, but does not establish a complete final-species composition.",
