              "bounded_scientific_conclusion": "Reconcile the authentic MediaDive ingredient960 lineage through existing Swine_Serum/UNMAPPED_0536. MediaDive lists1076b, and DSMZ1076b names heat-inactivated swine serum17ml separately from fetal bovine serum. The17ml is a receiving-medium dose, not a stock concentration. Heating temperature/time and supplier remain unstated. All original owner history is preserved. The separate Porcine_Serum/MD967 record is not declared untreated, merged or repurposed; the relationship of its unspecified processing to this preparation remains unresolved.",
              "not_blockers": [
                "Lack of an exact ontology or CAS can be handled with a source-qualified local preparation identity.",
                "Receiving-medium dose/unit normalization is separate.",
                "Supplier/lot refinement and complete publication review do not by themselves block bounded ingredient work."
              ],
              "preserved_constraints": [
                "Species, tissue/fraction, inactivation/lysis/sterility and stated schedules are retained.",
                "Unspecified protocols are not filled from a supplier FAQ or another recipe.",
                "No invented global raw-label alias, concentrations, solvent, product equivalence or complete component assertion.",
