            "disposition": "new_distinct_ingredient_proposal",
            "reasoning": "JCM1270 identifies the44g BD-Difco dry base before separate950mL water and50mL sheep blood. The actual manufacturer-authored BD2009 second-edition PDF, captured from NMSU, printedp158/PDFpage170, verifies the seven nominal Difco constituents and separately distinguishes BBL andEH. This replaces the original web-search wrapper as primary support. The approximate formula and performance-adjustment footnote do not prove a historical lot. Use CURATED_INTERPRETATION with COMPLETE limited to the seven immediate names in the nominal 2009 manufacturer list; historical JCM lot, performance adjustments and quantitative ratios remain unverified. No dry mass-ratio inference. Direct JCM sheep blood differs from MediaDive steps naming horse blood; MediaDive table gives100mLsheep/900mLwater. These receiving-medium discrepancies do not add blood or water to the dry base. A genuine same-path UNMAPPED_0118 partition proposal is now attached from its original maintained29ed63 preimage. Exact supported vendor dry routes are recorded separately from four held prepared-base contexts; neither the seven later context rows nor the external W04 case changes this frozen source membership. The exact BD-Difco vendor alias is supported for the dry candidate; generic provider2046 remains unresolved outside the positively linked J1270 source context.",
            "applicability": "Only frozen mediadive.ingredient:2046 BD-Difco44g row associated with JCM1270. Nominal2009 manufacturer formulation is supporting product context, not a historical-lot certificate. Existing mixed generic Columbia owner continuity remains coordinator work; no new broad source routes or alternate-product equivalence.",
            "missing_requirement": "No scientific fact blocks this bounded alias/partition/routing proposal. Actual guarded application must couple the exact0118 correction and vendor successor; historical lot, receiving-medium discrepancies and whole-owner/role/export review remain separate.",
